---
import LegalArticle from "@components/common/LegalArticle.astro"
import { site } from "@data/site"
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import { waLink } from "@lib/whatsapp"

// Mesmo conteúdo de /privacidade/, em inglês. Manter os dois em sincronia.
const analytics = Boolean(site.umamiWebsiteId)
const controller = site.legalName
  ? `${site.name} (${site.legalName})`
  : site.name
const dataRequest = waLink(
  "Hi! I have a request about my personal data (LGPD).",
)
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  routeKey="privacy"
  title="Privacy Policy | Hello World Estúdio"
  description="How the Hello World Estúdio website handles personal data: WhatsApp contact, cookieless usage metrics and your rights under Brazil's LGPD."
>
  <LegalArticle
    title="Privacy Policy"
    updated="Last updated: September 24, 2026"
  >
    <p>
      This policy explains, in plain language, what personal data this website
      processes, why, for how long and how you can exercise your rights under
      Brazil's General Data Protection Law (Law No. 13,709/2018, the LGPD).
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>{controller}</strong>, Brazilian company registration (CNPJ){" "}
      {site.cnpj}, is a software studio from{" "}
      {`${site.address.locality} (${site.address.region})`}, Brazil, that works
      fully online, and is the controller of the personal data processed through
      this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Data subject channel and DPO</h2>
    <p>
      As a small-sized processing agent, we are exempt from appointing a data
      protection officer (ANPD Resolution CD/ANPD No. 2/2022). Even so, any
      question or request about your data is handled directly by{" "}
      {site.founder.name}, founder, on WhatsApp at{" "}
      <a href={dataRequest} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {site.whatsapp.display}
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <h2>What data we process and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>WhatsApp contact.</strong> When you reach out, we receive the
        data you choose to send, such as your name, phone number and a
        description of your project. We use it to reply, prepare proposals and,
        if we work together, deliver the service. Legal basis: pre-contractual
        steps and performance of a contract (LGPD, art. 7, V). WhatsApp is a
        Meta service, which processes conversation data under its own privacy
        policy.
      </li>
      {analytics ? (
        <li>
          <strong>Usage metrics.</strong> We use Umami, a metrics tool that does
          not use cookies or identify you individually. It records aggregated
          data such as pages visited, referrer, device type and clicks on
          contact buttons, so we can understand what works on the website. Legal
          basis: legitimate interest (LGPD, art. 7, IX).
        </li>
      ) : (
        <li>
          <strong>Usage metrics.</strong> This website does not use analytics or
          visitor tracking tools.
        </li>
      )}
      <li>
        <strong>Hosting.</strong> The website is hosted on Cloudflare, which
        processes technical request data (such as IP address and browser) to
        deliver pages and protect the site against attacks. Legal basis:
        legitimate interest (LGPD, art. 7, IX).
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The website has no forms, sign-up or login area, and we never ask for
      sensitive data (health, religion, biometrics, etc.). We also do not make
      automated decisions about you based on your data.
    </p>

    <h2>Data in client projects</h2>
    <p>
      When we build a system for your company, we may access data about your
      customers or employees. In those cases your company is the controller and
      we act as the processor: we handle that data only to deliver the project,
      following your instructions and the contract, and never use it for any
      other purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies, so it shows no
      consent banner. Cloudflare may set strictly necessary cookies for
      security.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell or share your data for marketing purposes. It only goes
      through the providers listed above, as far as each service requires, or to
      authorities when required by law or court order.
    </p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Some of these providers (Cloudflare and Meta
      {analytics && ", as well as Umami"}) may process data on servers outside
      Brazil. These transfers follow article 33 of the LGPD and rely on the
      contractual data protection safeguards each provider offers.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Conversations that did not become a project:</strong> up to 2
        years after the last contact, so we can pick up where we left off if you
        come back. After that, we delete them.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Clients:</strong> for the length of the contract and, after it,
        for the period required by legal and tax obligations (usually 5 years).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Technical access data:</strong> for each provider's retention
        period, with no link to your identity.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If you ask for deletion before that, we delete everything we are not
      legally required to keep.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      The website only works over an encrypted connection (HTTPS) and sends
      security headers on every page. Access to conversations and client data is
      limited to the people working on the project, on accounts protected by
      two-factor authentication. If a security incident could put you at risk,
      we will notify you and the ANPD, as the law requires.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the LGPD (art. 18), you may request at any time, free of charge:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>confirmation that we process your data, and access to it;</li>
      <li>correction of incomplete, inaccurate or outdated data;</li>
      <li>
        anonymization, blocking or deletion of unnecessary data or data
        processed in breach of the law;
      </li>
      <li>portability of your data to another provider;</li>
      <li>information about who we share your data with;</li>
      <li>
        objection to processing based on legitimate interest, and withdrawal of
        consent where applicable.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Just message us on WhatsApp at{" "}
      <a href={dataRequest} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {site.whatsapp.display}
      </a>
      . We may ask you to confirm your identity first, to protect your data, and
      we reply within 15 days. If you are not satisfied, you may also file a
      complaint with Brazil's{" "}
      <a
        href="https://www.gov.br/anpd/pt-br"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        National Data Protection Authority (ANPD)
        <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <h2>Children and teenagers</h2>
    <p>
      This website and our services are aimed at businesses and adults. We do
      not knowingly collect data from anyone under 18.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      Some pages link to third-party websites (such as LinkedIn and WhatsApp).
      Once you click, that website's privacy policy applies.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated when the website or the law changes. The date
      at the top shows the current version.
    </p>
  </LegalArticle>
</BaseLayout>
